@startuml KTOB_11_sequence_acquisition
title KTOB - Offer Lookup, Historical Saving and Acquisition
actor Reader
participant "Angular" as UI
participant "Spring API" as API
participant "Acquisition" as Acquisition
participant "Provider adapter" as Adapter
participant "Seller research [BLOCKED]" as Seller
database "Supabase PostgreSQL" as DB
Reader -> UI : Choose country / format / language / maxPrice and currency
UI -> API : GET /catalog/works/{id}/offers
API -> Acquisition : validate price and currency query
alt maxPrice without valid currency
 Acquisition --> API : invalid filter
 API --> UI : 400 INVALID_PRICE_FILTER_CURRENCY
else Valid currency scope
alt Verified seller provider configured and available
 Acquisition -> Adapter : search offers
 Adapter -> Seller : request verified listings
 Seller --> Adapter : sourced offers, observedAt
 Adapter --> Acquisition : verified result
 Acquisition --> API : verified offers
API --> UI : 200 data[] meta.providerStatus=OK/PARTIAL
else Provider unavailable or unselected
 Acquisition --> API : unavailable result
API --> UI : 200 data=[] meta.providerStatus=UNAVAILABLE
end
end
opt Reader saves observed listing
 Reader -> UI : Enter source URL / observation details
 UI -> API : POST /library/{entryId}/saved-offers
 API -> Acquisition : check owner, archive status and sourceType
 alt Parent library entry archived
  Acquisition --> API : archived
  API --> UI : 409 LIBRARY_ENTRY_ARCHIVED
 else Active
  Acquisition -> DB : persist immutable observedAt snapshot (USER_SUPPLIED)
  Acquisition --> API : saved historical offer
  API --> UI : 201 saved offer
 end
end
opt Reader explicitly obtains a copy
 Reader -> UI : Record owned/borrowed/digital access
 UI -> API : POST /library/{entryId}/acquisitions
 API -> Acquisition : authenticate, check archive status, deduplicate
 alt Parent library entry archived
  Acquisition --> API : archived
  API --> UI : 409 LIBRARY_ENTRY_ARCHIVED
 else Active
  Acquisition -> DB : persist acquisition, no reading status changes
  Acquisition --> API : acquisition recorded
  API --> UI : 201 acquisition
 end
end
note over UI,DB
Saving an offer or visiting a seller never means purchase.
Only same-currency offers are compared against maxPrice;
unknown prices and other currencies excluded. No FX conversion.
Historic owned offers/acquisitions remain readable after archive.
Provider listings are not synthesized from AI suggestions.
end note
@enduml
